BT 1 0 0 1 0 98 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The Customer Support Ticket Priority Prediction and Automated Assignment System shows how) Tj T* (Salesforce Flow and Agentforce can reduce manual ticket handling. A new ticket is given a predicted) Tj T* (priority, a priority score and a support team as soon as it is saved. A second Flow finds the ticket) Tj T* (linked to an Account and classifies it, and an Agentforce subagent with a flow-based action is) Tj T* (configured to start that Flow from a conversation. The solution supports faster handling of urgent) Tj T* (tickets, more consistent routing and less repetitive work for the support team. The work was) Tj T* (completed in a Salesforce Developer Edition org using only configuration tools.) Tj T* ET
